#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.0.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: January 31, 2021"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:6
msgid "**4.0.5 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:13
msgid "Enhancements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:15
msgid ""
"New URL helper function :php:func:`url_to()` which creates absolute URLs "
"based on controllers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:16
msgid ""
"New Model option: ``$useAutoIncrement`` which when set to ``false`` "
"allows you to provide your own primary key for each record in the table. "
"Handy when we want to implement 1:1 relation or use UUIDs for our model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:17
msgid ""
"New URL helper function :php:func:`url_is()` which allows you to check "
"the current URL to see if matches the given string."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:18
msgid ""
"Services now have their config parameters strictly typehinted. This will "
"ensure no one will pass a different config instance. If you need to pass "
"a new config with additional properties, you need to extend that "
"particular config."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:19
msgid ""
"Support for setting SameSite attribute on Session and CSRF cookies has "
"been added. For security and compatibility with latest browser versions, "
"the default setting is ``Lax``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:20
msgid ""
"Guessing file extensions from mime type in "
"``Config\\Mimes::guessExtensionFromType()`` now only reverse searches the"
" ``$mimes`` array if no extension is proposed (i.e., usually not for "
"uploaded files)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:21
msgid ""
"The getter functions for file extensions of uploaded files now have "
"different fallback values (``UploadedFile::getClientExtension()`` for "
"``UploadedFile::getExtension()`` and ``''`` for "
"``UploadedFile::guessExtension()``). This is a security fix and makes the"
" process less dependent on the client."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:22
msgid ""
"The Cache ``FileHandler`` now allows setting the file permissions mode "
"via ``Config\\Cache``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:25
msgid "Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:27
msgid ""
"System messages defined in **system/Language/en/** are now strictly for "
"internal framework use and are not covered by backwards compatibility "
"(BC) promise. Users may use these messages in their applications but at "
"their own risks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:30
msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:32
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``BaseCommand::getPad()`` in favor of "
"``BaseCommand::setPad()``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:33
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\Controller::loadHelpers()`` in favor of "
"``helper()`` function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:34
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\Format::getFormatter()`` in favor of "
"``CodeIgniter\\Format\\Format::getFormatter()``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:35
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\Security\\Security::CSRFVerify()`` in favor of "
"``CodeIgniter\\Security\\Security::verify()``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:36
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\Security\\Security::getCSRFHash()`` in favor of"
" ``CodeIgniter\\Security\\Security::getHash()``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:37
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\Security\\Security::getCSRTokenName()`` in "
"favor of ``CodeIgniter\\Security\\Security::getTokenName()``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:38
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\App::$CSRFTokenName`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Security::$tokenName``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:39
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\App::$CSRFHeaderName`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Security::$headerName``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:40
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\App::$CSRFCookieName`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Security::$cookieName``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:41
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\App::$CSRFExpire`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Security::$expire``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:42
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\App::$CSRFRegenerate`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Security::$regenerate``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:43
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\App::$CSRFRedirect`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Security::$redirect``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:44
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\App::$CSRFSameSite`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Security::$samesite``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:45
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``migrate:create`` command in favor of ``make:migration`` "
"command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:46
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\Database\\ModelFactory`` in favor of "
"``CodeIgniter\\Config\\Factories::models()``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:47
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\Config\\Config`` in favor of "
"``CodeIgniter\\Config\\Factories::config()``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:48
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Message::getHeader()`` in favor of "
"``header()`` to prepare for PSR-7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:49
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Message::getHeaders()`` in favor of "
"``headers()`` to prepare for PSR-7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:50
msgid ""
"Deprecated ``Config\\Cache::$storePath`` in favor of "
"``Config\\Cache::$file['storePath']``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:53
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:55
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in ``Entity`` class where declaring class parameters was "
"preventing data propagation to the ``attributes`` array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:56
msgid ""
"Handling for the environment variable ``encryption.key`` has changed. "
"Previously, explicit function calls, like ``getenv('encryption.key')`` or"
" ``env('encryption.key')`` where the value has the special prefix "
"``hex2bin:`` returns an automatically converted binary string. This is "
"now changed to just return the character string with the prefix. This "
"change was due to incompatibility with handling binary strings in "
"environment variables on Windows platforms. However, accessing ``$key`` "
"using ``Encryption`` class config remains unchanged and still returns a "
"binary string."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:57
msgid ""
"``Config\\Services`` (in **app/Config/Services.php**) now extends "
"``CodeIgniter\\Config\\BaseService`` to allow proper discovery of third-"
"party services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.5.rst:59
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.0.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.0.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""

